('MINT/POL','POLITICS','2024-10-24','IND','POLITICS','POLITICS','POLITICS','PYSCRAPE','CM Omar Abdullah meets PM Modi following Amit Shah''s statehood assurance for J-K','https://www.livemint.com/politics/cm-omar-abdullah-meets-pm-modi-following-amit-shahs-statehood-assurance-for-jammu-and-kashmir-11729769088047.html','Oct 24, 2024 17:33:33','Jammu and Kashmir''s statehood may be restored as Chief Minister Omar Abdullah advocates for it after his recent election victory. In a meeting with Home Minister Amit Shah, Abdullah emphasized the need for security vigilance following recent violence in the region.','Oct 24, 2024 17:33:33'),
('MINT/POL','POLITICS','2024-10-24','IND','POLITICS','POLITICS','POLITICS','PYSCRAPE','Home Minister Amit Shah assures CM Omar Abdullah statehood for J&amp;K soon: Report','https://www.livemint.com/politics/news/amit-shah-assures-statehood-for-j-k-in-meeting-with-cm-omar-abdullah-report-11729755888905.html','Oct 24, 2024 13:26:13','The Union government may restore statehood to Jammu and Kashmir, five years post-bifurcation. Home Minister Amit Shah assured Chief Minister Omar Abdullah of support. The J&amp;amp;K cabinet''s resolution for statehood reflects the government''s commitment to protect local identity and rights.','Oct 24, 2024 13:26:13'),
('MINT/POL','POLITICS','2024-10-24','IND','POLITICS','POLITICS','POLITICS','PYSCRAPE','‘Until both the countries…,''says Mehbooba Mufti pushing for India-Pak reconcilation to end terror attacks in J&amp;K','https://www.livemint.com/politics/until-both-the-countries-sit-together-mehbooba-mufti-says-india-pakistan-need-to-reconcilse-to-end-terror-in-j-11729734131074.html','Oct 24, 2024 07:30:26','Mehbooba Mufti of the PDP said that Jammu and Kashmir suffers due to India-Pakistan animosity. She emphasised the need for reconciliation to prevent terror incidents, following a recent attack that killed seven. Mufti urged for dialogue to end violence affecting J&amp;amp;K''s residents.','Oct 24, 2024 07:30:26'),
