('MINT/POL','POLITICS','2024-10-24','IND','POLITICS','POLITICS','POLITICS','PYSCRAPE','Hindi imposition row: L Murugan questions TN DyCM, ‘Is Udhayanidhi Stalin a Tamil name?’','https://www.livemint.com/politics/news/hindi-imposition-row-union-minister-l-murugun-questions-tn-dycm-udhayanidhi-stalin-tamil-name-language-legal-india-news-11729659000616.html','Oct 23, 2024 11:02:40','Hindi imposition row: L Murugan responded to Udhayanidhi Stalin''s Hindi imposition comments by questioning the authenticity of his name and criticizing DMK''s stance. Deputy CM Stalin, facing legal challenges, has, however, maintained his position.','Oct 23, 2024 11:02:40');
